pp availability - 开发指南 - Documentation - Feishu Open ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"25ef52c89f3d12c9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.xfchat.iflytek.com/document/home/introduction-to-scope-and-authorization/availability\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c109932db50fb67b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe app availability defines which user groups (organizations, user groups, individuals) can use the app. It is suitable for scenarios where app usage permissions need to be controlled. For example, if you develop an app that only needs to be available to members of the IT department, you can set the app's availability to the IT department. In this way, members of other departments will not be ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c109932db50fb67b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.xfchat.iflytek.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7c6bf4dea58a12e8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nApifox - 简介 - 飞书 API\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7c6bf4dea58a12e8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feishu.apifox.cn/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"41a6bdf4e1d67add\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n简介 - 飞书 API 开发应用时，离不开调用服务端接口、监听订阅事件。这些操作可能会访问用户、租户的隐私信息，也可能操作用户、租户内的应用数据。出于数据安全考虑，应用需要申请资源访问的权限，并经过开放平台或租户管理员审核后，才可使用权限绑定的开放能力。简单来说，权限决定了 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"41a6bdf4e1d67add\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"feishu.apifox.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e79ee1a21f1896e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLark Developer\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e79ee1a21f1896e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.larksuite.com/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a4f74cad3d04fe0b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nDevelop applications agilely and efficiently settle in service providers. Lark Developer is committed to helping enterprises grow with advanced collaborative office concepts and products, and helping enterprises create a pleasant and efficient exclusive office platform.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a4f74cad3d04fe0b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.larksuite.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44d8abdc6ec53a6f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n调用飞书 OpenAPI | Runtime Hosting\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44d8abdc6ec53a6f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://dev.feishu.io/how-to/open-api.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c12e46c0554e99ff\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n调用飞书 OpenAPI 云函数提供了飞书服务端 OpenAPI 的 免鉴权调用，开发者无需手动完成 OpenAPI 的鉴权动作，即可使用内置的 SDK 进口飞书 OpenAPI 的调用。 使用 Tenant Access Token 调用 以 发送消息 为例，可以使用如下代码直接调用内置 SDK ，无感调用飞书开放平台 OpenAPI。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c12e46c0554e99ff\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"dev.feishu.io\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"80534b382a54ad36\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n飞书开放平台深度解析：从零构建企业级应用生态-csdn博客\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"80534b382a54ad36\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_01019/article/details/155763596\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8bbdbbe29da86e30\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n文章浏览阅读1.1k次，点赞22次，收藏29次。在数字化转型浪潮中，飞书开放平台作为连接企业应用与办公协作的核心枢纽，正成为企业构建智能化工作平台的重要基石。本文将从架构设计、开发实践到部署运维，全方位解析如何基于飞书开放平台打造稳定高效的企业级应用。## 企业应用生态的架构 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8bbdbbe29da86e30\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"blog.csdn.net\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9e4e790d6cc2552b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStep 4: Publish and use the application - Developer Guides ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9e4e790d6cc2552b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.larkenterprise.com/document/client-docs/h5/development-guide/st