{"type":"message","id":"7ae0a6fe","parentId":"ca06a3dd","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:57:52.079Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"主公选择了路径 B（应用跨租户对外共享）。让我进一步搜索关于这个功能的详细信息，包括具体操作步骤、配置要求等。\n\n从之前的搜索结果中，我只得到了该功能的摘要片段，但实际页面内容没有成功获取。让我再试试其他来源，看看能不能找到更详细的说明。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，我来深入查一下路径 B"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d4bed7c668fe40febbed873d","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"飞书 aPaaS 对外共享 开启 配置 教程","count":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bf7ca94c7c584360a377022a","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"飞书 跨租户 应用 被授权 外部企业 访问","count":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778943337907,"responseId":"09de14635e094934a2aeff7be40a79b5"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5e4da9b3","parentId":"7ae0a6fe","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:57:57.958Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d4bed7c668fe40febbed873d","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"飞书 aPaaS 对外共享 开启 配置 教程\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 2292,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"98819ec09bbe35df\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n帮助中心丨飞书 aPaaS - ae.feishu.cn\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"98819ec09bbe35df\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ae.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/categories-detail?category-id=7273031025604034562\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7029fd2b0c84f59f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n帮助中心提供飞书 aPaaS 平台的相关信息和支持，助力用户高效构建智能化业务应用。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7029fd2b0c84f59f\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ae.feishu.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8751d3b33feb7da1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n飞书APaaS权限管理：开启高效协作安全之门_哔哩哔哩_bilibili\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8751d3b33feb7da1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1i3hqzbESn/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fe32ba5029b59029\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n在数字化办公的浪潮中，飞书APaaS凭借其强大的功能为团队协作带来了前所未有的便捷性。然而，高效的协作离不开严谨的权限管理。本节内容将深入剖析飞书APaaS权限管理的精髓，从基础架构到实际应用，全方位解读如何通过精准的权限设置，保障团队数据安全，同时激发成员协作潜能，打造一个 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fe32ba5029b59029\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.bilibili.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e2854beb32e27b28\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw + 飞书，如何优雅地支持多人/家庭使用（附完整安装教程）\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e2854beb32e27b28\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2009068420373684537\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cc0d0f5258738d39\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n0. 前言前阵子，我给自己折腾了一个无所不能的飞书 AI 助理。女朋友看我在对话框里查资料、跑脚本用得飞起，果不其然丢来一句：\\\"看着挺香，给我飞书上也推一个呗。\\\" 我本来想着，把机器人名片推给她，或者干脆建…\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cc0d0f5258738d39\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"zhuanlan.zhihu.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fab81ee088b6509c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBot supports external groups and external users to chat\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fab81ee088b6509c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.xfchat.iflytek.com/document/uAjLw4CM/ukzMukzMukzM/develop-robots/add-bot-to-external-group\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"739183f2c537bee2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIf you want to add the app bot to an external group, or have a one-on-one chat with users of external tenants, you can enable external sharing for the bot. The external sharing capability currently only supports enterprise-built apps.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"739183f2c537bee2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.xfchat.iflytek.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"078babfc659e127e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n管理员如何打开飞书文档的对外分享？ - 问答 - Glarity\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"078babfc659e127e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://askai.glarity.app/zh-CN/search/%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E5%A4%96%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"da8323d4294fdd59\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n4. **确认设置**： - 如果在分享过程中没有看到对外分享的选项，可能是因为管理员未启用该功能。请再次检查管理后台的设置，确保所有相关权限已正确开启 [4] [6]。 通过以上步骤，管理员可以顺利地开启飞书文档的对外分享功能，方便外部用户访问相关资料。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"da8323d4294fdd