{"type":"message","id":"a6ed528a","parentId":"42534220","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:03:24.915Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5cf360b528be4b16912bfe14","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"feishu open platform enable external sharing bot enterprise-built app\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 11779,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a6e4b0de191d0267\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBot supports external groups and external users to chat\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a6e4b0de191d0267\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.xfchat.iflytek.com/document/uAjLw4CM/ukzMukzMukzM/develop-robots/add-bot-to-external-group\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7707a533bc73eed2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIf you want to add the app bot to an external group, or have a one-on-one chat with users of external tenants, you can enable external sharing for the bot . The external sharing capability currently only supports enterprise-built apps .\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7707a533bc73eed2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.xfchat.iflytek.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2a9b6bc02c1d2c08\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBot supports external groups and external users to chat\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2a9b6bc02c1d2c08\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ukzMukzMukzM/develop-robots/add-bot-to-external-group?lang=zh-CN\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f50a32099d82ff54\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo add your app's bot to external groups or start direct messages with users from external organizations, you can enable External Sharing for the bot . This feature is currently supported for custom apps .\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f50a32099d82ff54\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.feishu.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"76de7833ce6b4fcc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFeishu Application Setup | hyperlist/feishu-multi-agent | DeepWiki\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"76de7833ce6b4fcc\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://deepwiki.com/hyperlist/feishu-multi-agent/4.1-feishu-application-setup\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"848a048f7abe2cca\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStep 1 — Create the Enterprise Application Open the Feishu Open Platform . Create an Enterprise Self- Built Application (企业自建应用). Record the App ID (e.g. cli_xxx) and App Secret. These two values map directly to channels. feishu .accounts.default.appId and channels. feishu .accounts.default.appSecret in openclaw.json.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"848a048f7abe2cca\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"deepwiki.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a67500af5a85a514\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub - m1heng/clawdbot-feishu\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a67500af5a85a514\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/m1heng/clawdbot-feishu\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c6895bdb24fd38ae\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nConfiguration Create a self- built app on Feishu Open Platform Get your App ID and App Secret from the Credentials page Enable required permissions (see below) Configure event subscriptions (see below) ⚠️ Important Configure the plugin:\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c6895bdb24fd38ae\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"03b4e9a477708b2c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFeishu - OpenClaw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"03b4e9a477708b2c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.openclaw.ai/channels/feishu\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c9efd7e703bd0276\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFeishu /Lark is an all-in-one collaboration platform where teams chat, share documents, manage calendars, and get work done together. Status: production-ready for bot DMs + group chats.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c9efd7e703bd0276\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.openclaw.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"25e172de229022d9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nConnecting OpenClaw to Feishu (Lark): A Complete Integration Guide\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"25e172de229022d9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://openclaws.io/blog/openclaw-feishu-integration/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fc872db5f854a9bc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAfter adding permissions, click Publish to submit for review. In most enterprise tenants, self- built apps are auto-approved. Step 3: Enable Event Subscription 1. In the app settings, go to Event Subscriptions 2. Select WebSocket Mode (long connection) — this is critical. Do NOT use the webhook mode, as it requires a public URL. 3. Subscribe to these events: Step 4: Configure OpenClaw Add the ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fc872db5f854a9bc\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"openclaws.io\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8d8454284ce071e7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHow to Use Bot in Feishu - open.larkenterprise.com\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8d8454284ce071e7\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.larkenterprise.com/document/client-docs/bot-v3/how-to-use-bot-in-feishu\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bdc4981139da0e33\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGroup Bot Users can add your Bot to a group ( Bots can be added on Feishu for PC only) to make it interact with the group members. Go to ··· > Settings > Bots > Add Bot to add the Bot . When the Bot is added, the following scenarios can be realized: The Bot can send messages in the group; Group members can @mention and interact with the Bot .\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bdc4981139da0e33\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.larkenterprise.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"96bc6545724bab44\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHow to Connect Feishu to OpenClaw — nexu Integration Setup in 10 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"96bc6545724bab44\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://nexu.io/blog/how-to-deploy-feishu-ai-bot\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f0693ae6499a4ba6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nConnect Feishu to OpenClaw using nexu: grab your App ID and App Secret, import 102 permissions in one click, and your AI agent handles messages, docs, spreadsheets, and calendars — no public server needed.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f0693ae6499a4ba6\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"nexu.io\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7241a34539d45019\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nConnect OpenClaw to Feishu/Lark: Bring Your AI Assistant into ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7241a34539d45019\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://zerofuturetech.substack.com/p/connect-openclaw-to-feishulark-bring\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3d7b169c0665c6ce\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWant your OpenClaw bot inside Feishu /Lark? This tutorial walks you through the complete setup. Total time: under 20 minutes.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3d7b169c0665c6ce\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"zerofuturetech.substack.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3cdd7dff91fbd70\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw Setup (III): Connect a Feishu Bot | Haoming Wang\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3cdd7dff91fbd70\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://frank-haoming.github.io/blog/2026/openclaw-tutorial-3/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8144734b5e0195a2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOverview Once the local installation is working, the most direct way to extend the same OpenClaw setup into mobile and group-chat scenarios is to connect it to a Feishu bot . This post walks through the full path: enabling the local plugin, creating the app on the Feishu Open Platform , importing permissions, subscribing to events, and publishing the app .\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8144734b5e0195a2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"frank-haoming.github.io\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"feishu open platform enable external sharing bot enterprise-built app","provider":"duckduckgo","count":10,"tookMs":11779,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a6e4b0de191d0267\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nBot supports external groups and external users to chat\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a6e4b0de191d0267\">>>","url":"https://open.xfchat.iflytek.com/document/uAjLw4CM/ukzMukzMukzM/develop-robots/add-bot-to-external-group","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7707a533bc73eed2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIf you want to add the app bot to an external group, or have a one-on-one chat with users of external tenants, you can enable external sharing for the bot . The external sharing capability currently only supports enterprise-built apps .\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7707a533bc73eed2\">>>","siteName":"open.xfchat.iflytek.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2a9b6bc02c1d2c08\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nBot supports external groups and external users to chat\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2a9b6bc02c1d2c08\">>>","url":"https://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ukzMukzMukzM/develop-robots/add-bot-to-external-group?lang=zh-CN","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f50a32099d82ff54\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTo add your app's bot to external groups or start direct messages with users from external organizations, you can enable External Sharing for the bot . This feature is currently supported for custom apps .\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f50a32099d82ff54\">>>","siteName":"open.feishu.cn"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"76de7833ce6b4fcc\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nFeishu Application Setup | hyperlist/feishu-multi-agent | DeepWiki\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"76de7833ce6b4fcc\">>>","url":"https://deepwiki.com/hyperlist/feishu-multi-agent/4.1-feishu-application-setup","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"848a048f7abe2cca\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nStep 1 — Create the Enterprise Application Open the Feishu Open Platform . Create an Enterprise Self- Built Application (企业自建应用). Record the App ID (e.g. cli_xxx) and App Secret. These two values map directly to channels. feishu .accounts.default.appId and channels. feishu .accounts.default.appSecret in openclaw.json.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"848a048f7abe2cca\">>>","siteName":"deepwiki.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a67500af5a85a514\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGitHub - m1heng/clawdbot-feishu\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a67500af5a85a514\">>>","url":"https://github.com/m1heng/clawdbot-feishu","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c6895bdb24fd38ae\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nConfiguration Create a self- built app on Feishu Open Platform Get your App ID and App Secret from the Credentials page Enable required permissions (see below) Configure event subscriptions (see below) ⚠️ Important C