n add your Bot to a group ( Bots can be added on Feishu for PC only) to make it interact with the group members. Go to ··· > Settings > Bots > Add Bot to add the Bot . When the Bot is added, the following scenarios can be realized: The Bot can send messages in the group; Group members can @mention and interact with the Bot .\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bdc4981139da0e33\">>>","siteName":"open.larkenterprise.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"96bc6545724bab44\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHow to Connect Feishu to OpenClaw — nexu Integration Setup in 10 ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"96bc6545724bab44\">>>","url":"https://nexu.io/blog/how-to-deploy-feishu-ai-bot","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f0693ae6499a4ba6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nConnect Feishu to OpenClaw using nexu: grab your App ID and App Secret, import 102 permissions in one click, and your AI agent handles messages, docs, spreadsheets, and calendars — no public server needed.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f0693ae6499a4ba6\">>>","siteName":"nexu.io"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7241a34539d45019\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nConnect OpenClaw to Feishu/Lark: Bring Your AI Assistant into ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7241a34539d45019\">>>","url":"https://zerofuturetech.substack.com/p/connect-openclaw-to-feishulark-bring","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3d7b169c0665c6ce\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWant your OpenClaw bot inside Feishu /Lark? This tutorial walks you through the complete setup. Total time: under 20 minutes.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3d7b169c0665c6ce\">>>","siteName":"zerofuturetech.substack.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f3cdd7dff91fbd70\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOpenClaw Setup (III): Connect a Feishu Bot | Haoming Wang\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f3cdd7dff91fbd70\">>>","url":"https://frank-haoming.github.io/blog/2026/op